# Without this the build context is several gigabytes of node_modules, build
# output and yarn cache — all of it either reinstalled or rebuilt inside the
# image anyway.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/artifacts
**/cache
**/typechain-types
**/deployments
**/coverage
**/data
.yarn/cache
.yarn/install-state.gz
.git
.harness/runs
.harness/skills
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/passport.state.json
